  "title": "Returning traveler, flexible dates",
  "prompt": "I've been to Siargao before. My dates are flexible. Where should I go this time?",
  "keywords": [],
  "text": "## Siargao, the quieter side\n\nWelcome back. Since you have done the classics, here is how to plan a flexible return trip.\n\n**When to go**\n- March to June: calm water, easy island hopping, cheaper rooms.\n- September to November: biggest swell and the surf cup crowds at Cloud 9.\n\n**Suggested setup:** 1 week in April or May, stays up to PHP 3,500 per night (sample price).\n\n**Lesser-known spots**\n- **Pacifico** (North east coast): Long quiet beach and uncrowded waves. Stay two nights instead of a day trip.\n- **Magpupungko rock pools** (Pilar, low tide only): Go on a weekday morning at low tide. Check the tide table the night before.\n- **Sugba Lagoon by paddle board** (Del Carmen): Skip the jump platform crowd and paddle into the mangroves early.\n\nTell me your months, trip length and nightly budget and I will find dates and prices.",
